h1 Welcome to Wintersville High School's Graduation Class Website
h2 This website contains photos and videos of the different graduation classes by year.
h2 Photos and videos of Class Reunions are shown, as well as recent photos of our Classmates.
h2 All Classes from 1932 to 1993 are welcome to participate in this website. I am still looking for some yearbooks to borrow so I can include them in this website. 1932 - 1956; 1982 - 1985, and 1988. If you have one of these yearbooks I can borrow for about a week, use the contact page to let me know, or contact Pat Nuzum Class of 1969.  
